                <div class="col-md-12 col-lg-12">
                    <p>Batuk Bhairav is a youthful and benevolent form of Lord Bhairav, the fierce protector of the cosmos. Unlike the wrathful form of Bhairav, Batuk Bhairav is depicted as a child deity who provides blessings to his devotees for success, prosperity, and protection. Batuk Bhairav Anushthan is performed to remove obstacles, fulfill desires, and protect from enemies, and is especially beneficial for children and family well-being.</p>
